dfd flow.dfd -o flow.svg
cmp flow.svg want.svg

-- flow.dfd --
[This process has a genuinely long description that keeps going until it must wrap onto many lines]
> ok
[Uses supercalifragilisticexpialidociousconfiguration internally]
> done
[Short]
